WEBVTT

00:00:33.155 --> 00:00:35.331
[GRUNTING]

00:00:48.692 --> 00:00:49.781
[HOWLING]

00:00:53.001 --> 00:00:54.698
[YELLS IN PAIN]

00:01:43.704 --> 00:01:46.359
Remarkable, isn't it,

00:01:46.359 --> 00:01:48.056
how quickly the venom
of the basilisk

00:01:48.056 --> 00:01:50.145
penetrates the body?

00:01:50.145 --> 00:01:52.887
I'd guess you have little more
than a minute to live.

00:01:52.887 --> 00:01:55.977
You'll be with your dear
Mudblood mother soon, Harry.

00:02:01.548 --> 00:02:03.028
Funny...

00:02:03.028 --> 00:02:07.249
the damage
a silly little book can do...

00:02:07.249 --> 00:02:09.904
especially in the hands
of a silly, little girl.

00:02:13.777 --> 00:02:15.692
What are you doing?

00:02:18.434 --> 00:02:19.783
Stop! No!

00:02:19.783 --> 00:02:22.090
[♪♪♪]

00:03:12.619 --> 00:03:14.621
Ginny...

00:03:16.362 --> 00:03:20.148
Harry...it was me.

00:03:20.148 --> 00:03:23.369
But I swear,
I didn't mean to.

00:03:23.369 --> 00:03:24.761
Riddle made me,

00:03:24.761 --> 00:03:26.763
and...

00:03:26.763 --> 00:03:29.853
Harry, you're hurt.

00:03:29.853 --> 00:03:32.117
Don't worry.

00:03:32.117 --> 00:03:35.729
Ginny, you need
to get yourself out.

00:03:35.729 --> 00:03:38.253
Follow the Chamber,
and you'll find Ron.

00:03:38.253 --> 00:03:40.125
[FAWKES CRIES]

00:03:51.049 --> 00:03:53.268
You were
brilliant, Fawkes.

00:03:53.268 --> 00:03:56.228
I just wasn't quick enough.

00:04:17.292 --> 00:04:19.077
Of course.

00:04:19.077 --> 00:04:23.733
Phoenix tears
have healing powers.

00:04:23.733 --> 00:04:26.258
Thanks.

00:04:26.258 --> 00:04:28.216
It's all right, Ginny.

00:04:30.044 --> 00:04:33.787
It's over.

00:04:33.787 --> 00:04:36.007
It's just a memory.

00:04:37.356 --> 00:04:39.445
[♪♪♪]

00:04:39.445 --> 00:04:41.273
Amazing!

00:04:41.273 --> 00:04:43.536
This is just like magic!

